#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575672"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575776"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575912"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575956"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576096"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576216"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576316"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576508"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576572"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576652"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576768"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576896"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576940"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577068"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577196"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577304"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577392"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577484"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577632"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577716"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577848"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577948"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578108"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578236"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578328"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578460"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578560"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578768"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578892"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579024"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579116"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579240"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579320"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579424"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579512"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "579632"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "579716"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "579796"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "579864"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "579904"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "579936"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579968"
msgid "This must be… the exit?\nIt's like brand new, or freshly created…\nAnyway, I get that sort of a strong impression."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580084"
msgid "I confirmed the situation!\nThat over there is a structure different from\nthe Labyrinth up until now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580188"
msgid "I have yet to verify whether it's the exit\nor not, but there's no doubt that it's\n\"outside the Labyrinth\"!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580296"
msgid "Bingo!\nI was half-doubtful about all that stuff #C236196003BB#CDEF\nwas saying, but we did it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580392"
msgid "\"If you make it through the Labyrinth, you'll\nfind the exit.\" You mean that, right? Albeit\ngone rogue, #C236196003BB#CDEF is an AI. Lying to humans is―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580548"
msgid "Huh?\nHey #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, the monitor is acting u―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580612"
msgid "The transmission from the Student Council Room\ncut out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580668"
msgid "Judging from how #C236196003Rin#CDEF and the others were acting,\nI'd have to deem that there isn't anything wrong\non their side; there's a strong signal jammer\nveiling this space."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580848"
msgid "We've caught the culprit at last.\nThis is #C236196003BB#CDEF's domain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580920"
msgid "All that's left is to capture #C236196003BB#CDEF\nand escape from the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581032"
msgid "You beat #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF in your state. Now I have a\nslightly better opinion of you. Looks like your\nlevels came back. You're in tip-top shape鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581188"
msgid "I see you in a different light now, too.\nNever expected you to be a carnivore, or like,\nan outdoors person. Hehe. It's exciting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581320"
msgid "Or maybe, you've got the characteristics of\na pure protagonist who just doesn't ever listen?\nYes, it really―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581436"
msgid "Makes me want to trample you, you're that\noffensive. You're like those wriggling things\nthat scurry around underfoot in the summer."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581568"
msgid "The mood in the room does a 180."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581604"
msgid "―――Is this #C236196003BB#CDEF's true character?\nAll the floating particles in this space\nturn to hostility towards #C236196003#SVT#CDEF and I."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581752"
msgid "This is…!?\nStep back! Something mighty and strange is\ncoming!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581816"
msgid "Please step back #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND!\nThere's still something next to her…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581904"
msgid "Step back, mongrel.\nA difficult to describe filth is coming."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581968"
msgid "―――A surface and an edge."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582000"
msgid "An unprecedentedly mighty attack, along with an\nattack of unparalleled sharpness, assaults #C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582116"
msgid "You use #C000246204Egos#CDEF recklessly, #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nWe were only just born, you know?\nMy world hasn't even been readied yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582252"
msgid "Their presence isn't one of being Masters.\nDoes this mean #C236196003BB#CDEF still had other Servants\naround…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582368"
msgid "…this modding has gone too far…!\n#C236196003Lancer#CDEF looks cute compared to those two\ndeviant monsters…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582480"
msgid "Darling. Those two are enemies, much more\npowerful than that #C236196003lizard woman#CDEF.\nThis type of skill… it can't be…."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582608"
msgid "This is an exception. Don't move away from\nbehind me… I can't stay silent after being\nshown such things."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582716"
msgid "Guess I'll introduce you.\nThe two of them are #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF.\nOffshoots that were cut off from #C236196003#RUBS me#RUBEBB#REND#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582864"
msgid "That's because they're stuffed full of data\nfrom a \"certain category\" of Servant which the\n#C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF acquired."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582992"
msgid "These kids are #C255045045Composite Heroes#CDEF, so to speak.\n#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF was nothing more than child's play."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583116"
msgid "It can't be just that. The whimsical and\ninsolent magical energy of their wavelength is―\nTheir base isn't a Heroic Spirit, is it?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583248"
msgid "…it WOULD be better if they were just a\ncrossover of existing heroes. #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nYou had that kind of power all along?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583380"
msgid "…ahh, so this is what we're doing now.\nThat pointy one doesn't bother me, but…\nthe other one…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583480"
msgid "Hmph. It can't be merely that. It's revolting to\neven speak of, but there must be nothing more\nabhorrent than the limbs of those women."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583616"
msgid "Yes, as the nice Servant pointed out:\nthe base of these kids are Heroic Spirits,\nbut not human Heroic Spirits."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583728"
msgid "I drew from the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF part of the\nGoddess series. These are \"High Servants,\"\nreproduced Goddesses of mythology."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583860"
msgid "I'll let you in on one thing: as you are now,\nSenpai, you have absolutely no chance of\nwinning. Will you struggle for me anyway?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583992"
msgid "Struggle? Against those two strange people?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584036"
msgid "…as if.\nI can't even take a single step forward.\nMy reason and instincts are telling me that\n\"if I step forward, I'll be killed.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584168"
msgid "…this is unbelievable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584192"
msgid "The exit and #C236196003BB#CDEF are right in front of us,\nbut we can't take a single step ahead…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584292"
msgid "Endure the disgrace, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND.\nI'll endure too. All we can do now is withdraw."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584396"
msgid "…there's no way we can take on two opponents.\nMaster, get ready to retreat.\nWe'll get away from here at full speed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584516"
msgid "Darling, please listen.\n…this is where we withdraw. We're no match\nfor those chimeras as we are now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584620"
msgid "Don't mistake this for the right time to quit,\nmongrel. You're free to meet your maker, but I\nwon't accept defeat by those Goddesses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584756"
msgid "Done talking? Then go ahead and escape. I don't\nhave time to deal with ants who came here on\ntheir own only to just run away."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584884"
msgid "If any idiots come down to the third layer,\nyou can go ahead and use \"those\" to crush them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584976"
msgid "My world is still getting postponed a while?\nThen may I go to the Near Side, #C236196003BB#CDEF?\nI still haven't drained nearly enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585112"
msgid "Don't go overboard, you're too omnivorous.\nOver-ingesting nutrients is bad for your health."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585204"
msgid "So you see, this is what these kids are like.\nIf you want to capture me, you'll have to\neliminate them somehow."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585316"
msgid "But unfortunately for you, there's no hope for\nthat at all. I recommend you curl up and stay\nin the old school. If you do that, umm…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585452"
msgid "Ah, yes. Your minds should be safe after\nabout a year, as your bodies sense\nthe time to be, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585552"
msgid "Any longer and your minds will die of boredom,\nbut it's better than your bodies dying, right?\nEven now, you naturally cherish your lives."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585692"
msgid "Now then―――\nWill the humans without the courage to die be so\nkind as to pitifully make their exit?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585796"
msgid "Alright. Time for the customary blowy-blowy鷙\nOff to the old school, and awaaayyy♪"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585880"
msgid "Thanks to #C236196003Rani#CDEF buying me some time,\nI was able to make a new Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585968"
msgid "What will happen when the Labyrinth is\ncompleted―――You'll find out soon enough."
msgstr ""

